---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: artists
  size: 1
  alias: artist
permalink: "artists/{{ artist.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ artist.name }}"
---
<article class="artist-profile"><p class="eyebrow">Artist research profile · {{ artist.media }}</p><h1>{{ artist.name }}</h1><p class="intro">{{ artist.summary }}</p><section class="panel"><h2>Start here · see the work</h2>{% if artist.videos.length %}{% for video in artist.videos %}<iframe loading="lazy" src="{{ video.embed }}" title="{{ video.title }}" allowfullscreen></iframe><p>{{ video.title }} · <a href="{{ video.url }}">Source</a></p>{% endfor %}{% elif artist.images.length %}{% for item in artist.images %}<figure><img src="{{ item.src }}" alt="{{ item.alt }}" loading="lazy"><figcaption>{{ item.caption }} · <a href="{{ item.source }}">Image source / license</a></figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}{% else %}<p>Visual media is being verified. Until then, explore the artist's documented work at the institutional source below.</p><a href="{{ artist.source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View artwork and documentation at {{ artist.source.publisher }} ↗</a>{% endif %}</section><section><h2>Overview</h2><p>{{ artist.summary }}</p><p>Primary source: <a href="{{ artist.source.url }}">{{ artist.source.title }}</a> — {{ artist.source.publisher }}.</p></section><section><h2>Research &amp; Critical Perspectives</h2><p>Research leads, not verified scholarly references:</p><ul><li><a href="{{ artist.source.url }}">Institutional or artist publication</a></li><li><a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q={{ artist.name | slugify }}">Scholarly research</a></li><li><a href="https://www.google.com/search?q={{ artist.name | slugify }}">Interviews and criticism</a></li></ul></section><section id="references"><h2>References &amp; source documentation</h2><p class="muted">Research source records are provisional until individual authorship, title, publication date, and URL are verified. Missing dates must not be represented as confirmed publication years.</p><h3>Chicago Manual of Style · Notes and Bibliography</h3><h4>Bibliography</h4><p>{{ artist.source.publisher }}. “{{ artist.source.title }}.” {% if artist.source.verifiedDate %}{{ artist.source.verifiedDate }}{% else %}Accessed October 28, 2026{% endif %}. <a href="{{ artist.source.url }}">{{ artist.source.url }}</a>.</p><h4>Full note</h4><p>1. {{ artist.source.publisher }}, “{{ artist.source.title }},” {% if artist.source.verifiedDate %}{{ artist.source.verifiedDate }}{% else %}accessed October 28, 2026{% endif %}, <a href="{{ artist.source.url }}">{{ artist.source.url }}</a>.</p><h4>Shortened note</h4><p>{{ artist.source.publisher }}, “{{ artist.source.title }}.”</p><h3>APA · 7th edition</h3><p>{{ artist.source.publisher }}. ({% if artist.source.verifiedDate %}{{ artist.source.verifiedDate }}{% else %}n.d.{% endif %}). <i>{{ artist.source.title }}</i>. <a href="{{ artist.source.url }}">{{ artist.source.url }}</a></p><p class="muted">These are formatting drafts based on a directory source record, not independently verified bibliographic entries. Add separate entries for journal articles, exhibition catalogues, books, videos and interviews when verified.</p></section></article>
